<title>PORTUGAL: First day of European summit ends.</title>
<headline>First day of European summit ends.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>A European security summit of more than 50 nations ended its first day on Monday just after 1900 GMT. The summit of the Organisation for Security and Cooperation in Europe (OSCE) ends on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
